<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P puts Alcatel ratings on creditwatch.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P puts Alcatel ratings on creditwatch.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ratings agency Standard &amp; Poors said on Friday that it had put Alcatel Alsthom's A-1+ short-term and AA- long-term debt ratings on creditwatch with negative implications.</p>
</text>
